{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004378","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004378"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004378","label":"笑躄者美人未名（平原君虞卿列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"美人","mention_ids":["c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0023","c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0141","c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0245"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0023","chapter_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","quote":"美人"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0141","chapter_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","quote":"美人"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0245","chapter_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","quote":"美人"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"美人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004378","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"美人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004378","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0245","start":245,"end":247,"surface":"美人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004378","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji076-005","person_id":"cbr-p004378","surfaces":["美人"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-076-pingyu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","quote":"平原君家樓臨民家。民家有躄者，槃散行汲。平原君美人居樓上，臨見，大笑之。明日，躄者至平原君門，請曰：「臣聞君之喜士，士不遠千里而至者，以君能貴士而賤妾也。臣不幸有罷癃之病，而君之後宮臨而笑臣，臣願得笑臣者頭。」平原君笑應曰：「諾。」躄者去，平原君笑曰：「觀此豎子，乃欲以一笑之故殺吾美人，不亦甚乎！」終不殺。居歲餘，賓客門下舍人稍稍引去者過半。平原君怪之，曰：「勝所以待諸君者未嘗敢失禮，而去者何多也？」門下一人前對曰：「以君之不殺笑躄者，以君爲愛色而賤士，士即去耳。」於是平原君乃斬笑躄者美人頭，自造門進躄者，因謝焉。其後門下乃復稍稍來。是時齊有孟嘗，魏有信陵，楚有春申，故爭相傾以待士。"}],"rationale":"依前3段明示姓名與局部回指暫接，平原君趙勝、毛遂先生及明示遂短名限定範圍，取勝為普通詞不當趙勝。躄者、美人及門下前對者各存未名角色，不補名字；齊孟嘗魏信陵楚春申只存本篇所見，待另核跨篇對應。趙諸公子不補父親，三去相三復位未合成單一任期，諸君及十九二十食客群體不補成員。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:p002","text":"平原君家樓臨民家。民家有躄者，槃散行汲。平原君美人居樓上，臨見，大笑之。明日，躄者至平原君門，請曰：「臣聞君之喜士，士不遠千里而至者，以君能貴士而賤妾也。臣不幸有罷癃之病，而君之後宮臨而笑臣，臣願得笑臣者頭。」平原君笑應曰：「諾。」躄者去，平原君笑曰：「觀此豎子，乃欲以一笑之故殺吾美人，不亦甚乎！」終不殺。居歲餘，賓客門下舍人稍稍引去者過半。平原君怪之，曰：「勝所以待諸君者未嘗敢失禮，而去者何多也？」門下一人前對曰：「以君之不殺笑躄者，以君爲愛色而賤士，士即去耳。」於是平原君乃斬笑躄者美人頭，自造門進躄者，因謝焉。其後門下乃復稍稍來。是時齊有孟嘗，魏有信陵，楚有春申，故爭相傾以待士。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"躄者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004377","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"美人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004378","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"躄者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004377","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m002-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolv